 private func generateCollection()async{busy=true;status="\(selectedProfile.name) is researching up to \(requestedCount) shortcuts…";drafts=[];defer{busy=false}
  let prompt="""
Use web search to research this requested collection: \(title). Request details: \(topic)
Create exactly \(requestedCount) distinct, useful shortcut entries. Shortcut identifiers should be concise, unique, and derived from the phrase/name. Suggest 3–6 characters from an important word; avoid numbering unless needed for duplicates. Do not wrap phrases, names, or codes in quotation marks or include slash characters in codes. Keep each phrase concise, original, and useful when pasted into another app. Include source URLs for factual claims. Prefer authoritative sources for accounting standards. For music and bhajan collections, provide titles, verified artist/language details, original short descriptions, themes, and lawful listening pages; do not reproduce copyrighted lyrics. Do not reproduce full copyrighted standards or other long protected text.
